{"name":"Deepest Nightmare","hex":"#44413c","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"deepest","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["superlative form of deep: most deep."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/deepest"},{"term":"nightmare","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A very unpleasant or frightening dream. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","Any bad, miserable, difficult or terrifying situation or experience that arouses anxiety, terror, agony or great displeasure."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To experience a nightmare.","To imagine (someone or something) as in a nightmare."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/nightmare"}],"entries":[{"title":"Nightmare","blocks":[{"text":"A nightmare, also known as a bad dream, is an unpleasant dream that can cause a strong emotional response from the mind, typically fear but also despair, anxiety, disgust or sadness. The dream may contain situations of discomfort, psychological or physical terror, or panic. After a nightmare, a person will often awaken in a state of distress and may be unable to return to sleep for a short period of time. Recurrent nightmares may require medical help, as they can interfere with sleeping patterns and cause insomnia."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/63/Henry_Fuseli_%281741%E2%80%931825%29%2C_The_Nightmare%2C_1781.jpg/330px-Henry_Fuseli_%281741%E2%80%931825%29%2C_The_Nightmare%2C_1781.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nightmare"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/Dream_of_the_Rarebit_Fiend_1905-02-25_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Dream_of_the_Rarebit_Fiend_1905-02-25_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/Dream_of_the_Rarebit_Fiend_1905-02-25_%28cropped%29.jpg/1280px-Dream_of_the_Rarebit_Fiend_1905-02-25_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/Dream_of_the_Rarebit_Fiend_1905-02-25_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Dream_of_the_Rarebit_Fiend_1905-02-25_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A panel from the early 20th-century comic Dream of the Rarebit Fiend, whose protagonists regularly suffer nightmares after eating cheese.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADream_of_the_Rarebit_Fiend_1905-02-25_(cropped).jpg"}],"sounds":{"deepest":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5b/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Wodencafe-deepest.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5b/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Wodencafe-deepest.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Wodencafe-deepest.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5b/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Wodencafe-deepest.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Wodencafe-deepest.wav.ogg"}],"nightmare":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d3/En-us-nightmare.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d3/En-us-nightmare.ogg/En-us-nightmare.ogg.mp3"}]}}}